<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Healthcare System – Welcome</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background-color: #eef3f8;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1e2b3c;
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }
    .email-container {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 40, 80, 0.08);
    }
    .email-header {
      padding: 36px 32px 28px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9f0f7;
    }
    .logo-mark {
      background: #1b6b8f;
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: white; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .brand-text {
      font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #0b2a41;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .brand-text span {
      font-weight: 400; color: #6a8aa5;
      font-size: 13px; display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .email-content { padding: 32px; }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #0b2a41; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .message-text {
      font-size: 15px; color: #4a647c;
      margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .success-card {
      background: #f0faf4;
      border: 1px solid #c8e6d5;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .success-icon {
      width: 56px; height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #2e7d5e;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: white; font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(46, 125, 94, 0.25);
    }
    .success-label {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a5c43; margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .success-note {
      font-size: 13px; color: #4a7c65;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #f7fafd;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4a647c;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .info-box strong {
      color: #0b2a41;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .info-box ul {
      margin: 0 0 0 18px;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .info-box li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .info-box li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .info-box li strong {
      display: inline;
      color: #1b6b8f;
      font-weight: 600;
    }


    .security-note {
      background: #f7fafd;
      border-left: 3px solid #1b6b8f;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #4a647c;
      display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .security-note p { margin: 0; }
    .signature {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4a647c;
    }
    .signature strong {
      display: block;
      color: #0b2a41;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .email-header, .email-content { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
      
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <div class="email-header">
      <div class="logo-mark">✚</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        Healthcare System
        <span>secure patient portal</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="email-content">
      <div class="greeting">Welcome aboard, <%= userName %> 👋</div>
      <div class="message-text">
        Your email has been verified and your Healthcare System account is now active. We're glad to have you with us.
      </div>

      <div class="success-card">
        <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
        <div class="success-label">Your account is ready</div>
        <div class="success-note">
          Verified on <%= date %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>Here's what you can do next</strong>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Book an appointment</strong> with a doctor or specialist</li>
          <li><strong>View your medical records</strong> and lab results anytime</li>
          <li><strong>Manage prescriptions</strong> and receive reminders</li>
          <li><strong>Message your care team</strong> securely from the portal</li>
        </ul>
      </div>


      <div class="security-note">
        <span style="font-size:16px;">🔒</span>
        <p>For your security, never share your password with anyone. Healthcare System will never ask for it via phone or email.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="signature">
        If you have any questions, our support team is always happy to help.
        <strong>— Healthcare System Team</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>